<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Altera started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Altera started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said on Wednesday analyst Scott Nirenberski had started coverage of semiconductor maker Altera Corp with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In an analysis, Nirenberski wrote in part that Altera was gaining share in the market for programmable logic devices and new product bookings and sales were accelerating from December.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were up 2-1/2 to 43 in midday trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
